    "methods_description": "CCEPs were recorded with subdural ECoG during single pulse electrical stimulation, either in the awake state for clinical purposes (SPES-clinical) or under propofol anesthesia (SPES-propofol). Electrode positions were estimated by running Freesurfer on each subject's MRI and converted to MNI305 space using the Freesurfer surface-based non-linear transformation.",
